https://github.com/NVIDIA/Personal-AI-Router, Apache License 2.0, Copyright (c) 2026 NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES), with
their LICENSE and third-party notices beside them. At install it fetches NVIDIA OpenShell 0.1.4
